[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わーっ、海ってやっぱり広いね！\u3000\n見渡す限り水ばっかり！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, the ocean really is huge! Nothing but water as far as the eye can see!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に……\n何度見ても、不思議な気持ちになるね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It really is... No matter how many times I see it, it never stops feeling magical."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。余計なものが何もなくて、風も心地いい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Nothing in the way, and the breeze feels so nice."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……こんなに何もない場所、なんだか落ち着かない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...There's so little out here. It actually makes me a little uneasy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、たまには悪くないだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Every now and then, that's not so bad."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルテス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cortes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカ、体調が悪くなったらすぐに言うのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca, if you start feeling sick, tell me right away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう、大丈夫よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm fine, really."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははっ、姉妹仲良しでいいな。\nな、シャリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, nice to see you two looking out for each other. Right, Shallie?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルテス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cortes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、そうですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, definitely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……こうしていられるのも、あとどれくらいかしらね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I wonder how much longer we'll get to have days like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……姉さん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Sis?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ううん、なんでもない。\nちょっと、感傷に浸っちゃっただけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It's nothing. I just got a little sentimental for a moment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇねぇ、もうすぐつく？\nヴィアベル州、そろそろ見えるかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, are we almost there? Can you see Wirbel Province yet?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだ見えないけど……風が強くなってきたね。\nヴィアベル州が近いのかも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not yet, but... the wind's picking up. Maybe we're getting close!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……コルテス、波が高くなってきたわ。\n操縦、大丈夫？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Cortes, the waves are getting rougher. Can you manage?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "問題ない。だが、お前らはしっかり掴まってろ。\nヴィアベル州の沖は、潮の流れが複雑だからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No problem. But hold on tight, all of you. The currents off Wirbel Province can get tricky."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルテス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cortes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……船が揺れて、ちょっと気持ち悪いかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...The rocking is starting to get to me a little."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカ、大丈夫？\u3000\n私に寄りかかってくれていいわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you okay? You can lean on me if you need to."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ありがと、姉さん。\n少しだけ、借りるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thanks, Sis. Just for a little while."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。存分に頼ってちょうだい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. Lean on me as much as you need."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]